{
  "protocol": "photovault-server-qr",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "服务器二维码协议 v1 的共享测试向量。服务端 pytest 与 Android JVM 单测读取同一份文件；协议定义见 qr-dual-address 设计文档第 2、3 节。",
  "grammar": "payload = \"photovault://connect?\" param *(\"&\" param); param = key [\"=\" value]; v = [1-9][0-9]{0,8}（恰好一次，整串匹配，不做百分号解码）; public / lan = 百分号编码的规范地址 scheme://host[:port]（各至多一次，至少一个非空）; 只有 public / lan 的值做严格百分号解码; 其他 key（含空 key）连同其值整段忽略; 版本判定先于地址解码; 编码只保留 RFC 3986 unreserved（A-Z a-z 0-9 - . _ ~），其余按 UTF-8 字节 %XX 大写；解码时 + 不表示空格",
  "address_validation": [
    {"input": "HTTPS://Photos.Example.com:443/", "canonical": "https://photos.example.com"},
    {"input": "192.168.1.10:8000", "canonical": "http://192.168.1.10:8000"},
    {"input": "  HTTP://NAS.Local:80/  ", "canonical": "http://nas.local"},
    {"input": "https://nas.local:80", "canonical": "https://nas.local:80"},
    {"input": "http://a:080", "canonical": "http://a"},
    {"input": "http://a/", "canonical": "http://a"},
